			"notes": "- [SERVER/LAN only] Implemented autosave interval command\n- Fixed LAN worlds character loading\n- Fixed advancement icons and descriptions\n- Fixed a bug where character positions in multiplayer weren't being saved\n- Items inside backpacks are now being saved\n- Display name now matches character name instead of player's account username in servers/chat\n- Added the possibility to recover legacy data from your previous character inside a world (before the mod was installed). To do that, simply create a new character with the same name as your account username (the same account you were using to play in the world you want to recover the data from)"
		},
