			"notes": "### **Multiplayer Character Mod Progression**\n**Mod progression** is now working on **servers**, with a couple of seconds (30 seconds approximately) for mod data and advancements to **autosave** so the character doesn't lose progress when quitting the world. If playing singleplayer/offline, progress is saved instantly and you don't have to worry about it.\n\n> [!WARNING] \n> Be sure to wait one or two minutes before leaving a server if you recently did something mod related (e.g. catching/scanning Pokémon in Cobbleverse).\n\n### **Future Plans**\n_I'm currently working on implementing a server console command so the server owners can configure the time between character mod data autosaves. Also, there are still a couple of UI fixes to be released and I'm thinking of a backup feature to recover characters in case anything goes wrong._"
		},
